  "final_text": "New chat\nImages\nPlugins\nDeep research\nSee plans and pricing\nHelp\nSettings\nGet responses tailored to you\n\nLog in to get answers based on saved chats, plus create images and upload files.\n\nLog in\nChatGPT\nLog in\nSign up for free\nYou said:\n\nhii\n\nChatGPT said:\n\nHii! \ud83d\udc4b\ud83d\ude0a\nHow are you doing? What can I help you with today?\n\nYou said:\n\nhwllo my name is reo\n\nChatGPT said:\n\nHello, Reo! \ud83d\ude04\ud83d\udc4b Nice to meet you!\n\nWhat are you up to today?\n\nYou said:\n\nwhats your name\n\nChatGPT said:\n\nI\u2019m ChatGPT \ud83d\ude0a You can call me GPT if you want!\n\nNice to meet you, Reo! \ud83d\udc4b\u2728\n\nYou said:\n\nsuper tell mee the 20 best tamil movies\n\nChatGPT said:\n\nAbsolutely, Reo! \ud83d\ude0e\ud83d\udd25 If we're talking about 20 of the best Tamil movies ever, I'd go with a mix of classics, critically acclaimed films, and fan favorites:\n\n\ud83c\udfac Nayakan (1987) \u2014 Kamal Haasan\n\n\ud83c\udfac Pariyerum Perumal (2018) \u2014 Kathir, Anandhi\n\n\ud83c\udfac Anbe Sivam (2003) \u2014 Kamal Haasan, Madhavan\n\n\ud83c\udfac Aaranya Kaandam (2011) \u2014 Jackie Shroff, Ravi Krishna\n\n\ud83c\udfac Super Deluxe (2019) \u2014 Vijay Sethupathi, Fahadh Faasil, Samantha\n\n\ud83c\udfac Jigarthanda (2014) \u2014 Siddharth, Bobby Simha\n\n\ud83c\udfac Kaaka Muttai (2014) \u2014 Ramesh, Aishwarya Rajesh\n\n\ud83c\udfac Visaranai (2015) \u2014 Dinesh, Samuthirakani\n\n\ud83c\udfac Vikram Vedha (2017) \u2014 R. Madhavan, Vijay Sethupathi\n\n\ud83c\udfac Soorarai Pottru (2020) \u2014 Suriya,\n\nChatGPT is AI and can make mistakes.\n\nChat with ChatGPT\nResponse stopped",
